source_site.csv -&gt; ods.source_site
Kept by hand in ${REFERENCE_DIR}/source_site.csv. Insert/update: new rows are added, changed rows updated.
A row removed from the CSV stays in the table: delete it there by hand.
No reject branch on purpose: a wrong row stops the load, so it gets fixed in the file.</note>
